   "B": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the administrative code of the city of New York, in relation to directing the department of transportation of the city of New York to study and report on its current and planned efforts to educate pedestrians and drivers relating to being distracted while using a mobile device; and providing for the repeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S478",
